<title>UK: TABLE - Pearson H1 pretax profit surges.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Pearson H1 pretax profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June 30</p>
<p>		   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.1		   vs 2.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.5		    vs 6.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     81		     vs 30</p>
<p> Turnover		   958		    vs 940</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 43 and 48 million stg.</p>
<p>Adjusted EPS was 6.0p versus 4.0p.</p>
<p>Full company name - Pearson Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
